From 7b4512ec338891efab46a61919bfd8587841f2e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: axon7-port <axon7-port@localhost>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 23:43:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] axon7: BoardConfig, fstab and init for lineage-22.2

As LineageOS/android_device_xiaomi_msm8996-common 18.1 -> 22.2: board flags
dropped by newer Android removed; boot_devices cmdline; kernel: the 4.4
msm8996 base (mi8996_defconfig + vendor/zte/axon7.config, to be written
with the kernel port); qcom-caf framework matrices; product/system/vendor
.prop files; vendor sepolicy dir; LOC HIDL 3.0; vendor RIL service; AVB
off. rootdir/ -> init/ as Soong prebuilt_etc/sh_binary; fstab with
first-stage mount and ext4 /data with FBE (needs a userdata format);
libinit keeps the alarm boot detection and adds 4 GB dalvik heap props;
init rc: writepid -> task_profiles, sys.powerctl -> sys.shutdown.requested,
restricted cpuset. RIL/data daemon changes wait for the 22.2 blobs.
